{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=curated_00014","headline":"杂歌谣辞·苏小小歌 · 张祜","name":"杂歌谣辞·苏小小歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"车轮不可遮，马足不可绊。长怨十字街，使郎心四散。 新人千里去，故人千里来。翦刀横眼底，方觉泪难裁。 登山不愁峻，涉海不愁深。中擘庭前枣，教郎见赤心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/curated_00014.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=curated_00014","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于与开放语料未能唯一对齐，保留为整理本异文/组诗条目","citation":"周啸天"}